<title>NIGERIA: Abacan Nigerian oil well hits 4,000 bpd.</title>
<headline>Abacan Nigerian oil well hits 4,000 bpd.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abacan Resources and its Nigerian partner Amni Petroleum have drilled an exploratory offshore well with estimated production of 4,000 barrels per day (bpd), a local newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The independent Vanguard newspaper said the discovery, off Bonny, was at a depth of 14,360 feet (4,400 m). It did not specify in which block, or when, the find was made.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317</p>
</text>
